Package: RNAseqBasic
Title: Helper Functions for RNA-Seq Differential Expression Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("K. Garrett", "Evensen", , "kgsevensen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6720-2526"))
Description: A small collection of convenience functions for RNA-seq
    differential expression workflows, including gene ID/symbol conversion
    via Ensembl BioMart, volcano plot generation, and WebGestalt enrichment
    analysis.
